Package: ConDAdist
Title: Consensus Differential Abundance With Distance-Guided Scoring
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Heekuk", "Park", email = "heekukpark@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a distance-guided consensus framework for microbiome
    differential abundance analysis. The package centers on the
    orchestrator Go_ConDaDist(), which supports both single-method
    differential abundance runs and multi-method consensus runs.
    ConDAdist standardizes outputs across supported DA methods,
    optionally integrates beta-diversity contribution evidence, exports
    directory-first CSV results, and creates bridge files for
    downstream volcano plotting with the existing Go tool family.
